{
    "title": "Books - Read and Download",
    "description": "Delve into a universe of English literature with our free app to read free English books and download free English books in epub, mobi, pdf, html or plain text. The mobile library that offers you endless books in English that have stood the test of time. Here you will find books whose copyrights have expired, available to read and download completely free of charge.\r\n\r\nOn the main screen, you will have the option to read books or download them. If what you are looking for is to enjoy reading free books, you will have at your disposal an extensive list of classic works to read calmly from your mobile. Our app is designed to be easy to use so that you can start reading your favorite English book instantly.\r\n\r\nIf you want to download free books like mobi ebooks, pdf ebooks or epub ebooks, you will be shown a list of books to download. Once the download permissions are accepted, the books will be quickly downloaded to your mobile device, in a new folder, so you will have to check your folders to see the book in the format of your choice, be it epub, mobi, pdf, html or plain text.\r\n\r\nNot only do we offer a wide selection of books, but we have also implemented a new feature that allows you to choose the books you want to read based on your preferred language. In this way, you will be able to learn a new language through reading, be it in English, Spanish, German, French or in many other languages such as English. This function is especially useful when we want to read a book not in our own language in English, but in the language that we are learning.\r\n\r\nIn addition to selecting by language, you can also choose books based on different themes and collections, so you'll always find something of interest, whether it's mystery novels, science fiction, classics, or adventure stories. Thus, each reading trip in English is a personalized and unique experience.\r\n\r\nReminder: All the books published in our application are not copyrighted, we will find classic books like Don Quixote and many other works with which you can rekindle your love for reading, something so important these days to increase your culture and knowledge.\r\n\r\nDiscover the pleasure of reading and learning with our free application in English, and immerse yourself in a world of knowledge without limits. Download now and start your literary journey.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Delve into a universe of English literature with our free app to read free English books and download free English books in epub, mobi, pdf, html or plain text. The mobile library that offers you endless books in English that have stood the test of time. Here you will find books whose copyrights have expired, available to read and download completely free of charge.<br><br>On the main screen, you will have the option to read books or download them. If what you are looking for is to enjoy reading free books, you will have at your disposal an extensive list of classic works to read calmly from your mobile. Our app is designed to be easy to use so that you can start reading your favorite English book instantly.<br><br>If you want to download free books like mobi ebooks, pdf ebooks or epub ebooks, you will be shown a list of books to download. Once the download permissions are accepted, the books will be quickly downloaded to your mobile device, in a new folder, so you will have to check your folders to see the book in the format of your choice, be it epub, mobi, pdf, html or plain text.<br><br>Not only do we offer a wide selection of books, but we have also implemented a new feature that allows you to choose the books you want to read based on your preferred language. In this way, you will be able to learn a new language through reading, be it in English, Spanish, German, French or in many other languages such as English. This function is especially useful when we want to read a book not in our own language in English, but in the language that we are learning.<br><br>In addition to selecting by language, you can also choose books based on different themes and collections, so you&#39;ll always find something of interest, whether it&#39;s mystery novels, science fiction, classics, or adventure stories. Thus, each reading trip in English is a personalized and unique experience.<br><br>Reminder: All the books published in our application are not copyrighted, we will find classic books like Don Quixote and many other works with which you can rekindle your love for reading, something so important these days to increase your culture and knowledge.<br><br>Discover the pleasure of reading and learning with our free application in English, and immerse yourself in a world of knowledge without limits. Download now and start your literary journey.",
